{"id":"ad14eb2fc6e8b9b5","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-prop-vk.md","title":"$V {\\kappa}$ Universe","display":"prop-vk — $V_{\\kappa}$ Universe","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-vk","aliases":["58-prop-vk"],"display":"prop-vk — $V_{\\kappa}$ Universe","depends_on":["[[58-df-hierarchy]]","[[58-df-zfc-inaccessible-cardinal]]","[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-proper]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-vk"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-vk</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-vk — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{\\kappa}\">\\(V_{\\kappa}\\)</span> Universe"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"58-df-hierarchy\">58-df-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e1b64da99640200\" href=\"?note=3e1b64da99640200\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inaccessible-cardinal\">58-df-zfc-inaccessible-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper\">58-df-proper</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InaccessibleCardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{InaccessibleCardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Model}\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{Model}\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathfrak V_\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathfrak V_\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InaccessibleCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InaccessibleCardinal}_S\\)</span> is the imported inaccessible-cardinal predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\kappa,V_\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\kappa,V_\\kappa)\\)</span> builds the set-coded membership structure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\kappa\">\\(V_\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> is the set of sentences from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Model}\">\\(\\operatorname{Model}\\)</span> is the satisfaction-based model predicate</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}vk}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InaccessibleCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak V_\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\kappa,V_\\kappa)\n\\land\\operatorname{Model}(\\mathfrak V_\\kappa,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}vk}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InaccessibleCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak V_\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\kappa,V_\\kappa)\n\\land\\operatorname{Model}(\\mathfrak V_\\kappa,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The membership relation is supplied through an actual set-coded membership structure and evaluated by the registered model predicate; the malformed exponent <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\kappa^{,2}\">\\(V_\\kappa^{,2}\\)</span> and raw infix satisfaction notation are removed.</li>\n<li>The converse was removed: cardinals with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\kappa\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(V_\\kappa\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> are called worldly and need not be inaccessible.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inaccessible-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"3e1b64da99640200","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inaccessible-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-proper","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-proper]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}$ is the set of sentences from [[58-ax-zfc]], and $\\operatorname{Model}$ is the satisfaction-based model predicate","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V_{\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InaccessibleCardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Model}\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa,\\mathfrak V_\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InaccessibleCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\kappa,V_\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Model}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}vk}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InaccessibleCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak V_\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\kappa,V_\\kappa)\n\\land\\operatorname{Model}(\\mathfrak V_\\kappa,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"V_\\kappa^{,2}","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\kappa\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false}],"bytes":1546,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4013","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-prop-vk.md|58-prop-vk]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["19e9a8c33d5c841c","3e1b64da99640200","a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","8935dcac821c0104","8b6a90316aad78a4"]}